"https://www.cnews.ru/analytics/infographics\">Инфографика</a></li>\n        \n\n\n        \n        \n        \n        \n        \n        \n        \n        \n        \n        \n        \n        \n        \n        \n        \n        \n        \n        \n        \n        \n        \n        \n        \n        \n        \n        \n        \n        \n        \n        \n        \n        \n        \n        \n        \n        \n        \n        \n        \n        \n        \n        \n        \n        \n        \n        \n        \n        \n        \n        \n        \n        \n        \n        \n        \n        \n        \n        \n        \n        \n        \n        \n        \n        \n        \n        \n        \n        \n        \n        \n        \n        \n        \n        \n        \n        \n        \n        \n        \n        \n        \n</ul>\n\n\n\n        \n\n        \n                    \n                \n\n\n\n    \n            <!-- <p class=\"article-top-author\">Анна Любавина</p> -->\n    \n            <p>16 Октября 2026 15:45\n            16 Окт 2026 15:45\n            \t\t\t\t\t\n\t\t\t                \n            \n                        \n            |</p>\n        \n    \n    <h2>\n        «Аэрофлот» первым в России установил новейшие платежные терминалы Сбербанка с искусственным интеллектом\n                \n    </h2>\n    \n        \n    \n\n            \n    \n    \n\n    \n    \n\t\n\t        \n        \n            \n            <p>Сбербанк и «<a href=\"https://www.cnews.ru/book/%D0%90%D1%8D%D1%80%D0%BE%D1%84%D0%BB%D0%BE%D1%82_-_%D0%A0%D0%BE%D1%81%D1%81%D0%B8%D0%B9%D1%81%D0%BA%D0%B8%D0%B5_%D0%B0%D0%B2%D0%B8%D0%B0%D0%BB%D0%B8%D0%BD%D0%B8%D0%B8_-_Aeroflot_-_%D0%B0%D0%B2%D0%B8%D0%B0%D0%BA%D0%BE%D0%BC%D0%BF%D0%B0%D0%BD%D0%B8%D1%8F\">Аэрофлот</a>» запустили во флагманском офисе продаж авиакомпании НЕО — первый в мире <a href=\"https://www.cnews.ru/book/%D0%9A%D0%9A%D0%A2_-_%D0%9A%D0%BE%D0%BD%D1%82%D1%80%D0%BE%D0%BB%D1%8C%D0%BD%D0%BE-%D0%BA%D0%B0%D1%81%D1%81%D0%BE%D0%B2%D0%B0%D1%8F_%D1%82%D0%B5%D1%85%D0%BD%D0%B8%D0%BA%D0%B0_-_mPOS_-_SoftPOS_-_POS-%D1%82%D0%B5%D1%80%D0%BC%D0%B8%D0%BD%D0%B0%D0%BB_point_of_sale_-_%D0%BE%D0%BD%D0%BB%D0%B0%D0%B9%D0%BD-%D0%BA%D0%B0%D1%81%D1%81%D1%8B_-_%D0%BE%D0%B1%D0%BB%D0%B0%D1%87%D0%BD%D1%8B%D0%B5_%D0%BA%D0%B0%D1%81%D1%81%D1%8B_-_%D0%B8%D0%BD%D1%82%D0%B5%D1%80%D0%BD%D0%B5%D1%82-%D1%8D%D0%BA%D0%B2%D0%B0%D0%B8_%D1%80%D0%B8%D0%BD%D0%B3_-_%D0%BC%D0%BE%D0%B1%D0%B8%D0%BB%D1%8C%D0%BD%D0%B0%D1%8F_%D0%BA%D0%B0%D1%81%D1%81%D0%B0_-_%D0%BF%D0%BB%D0%B0%D1%82%D0%B5%D0%B6%D0%BD%D1%8B%D0%B9_%D1%82%D0%B5%D1%80%D0%BC%D0%B8%D0%BD%D0%B0%D0%BB_-_%D0%B5%D0%B4%D0%B8%D0%BD%D1%8B%D0%B9_%D0%BA%D0%B0%D1%81%D1%81%D0%BE%D0%B2%D1%8B%D0%B9_%D1%87%D0%B5%D0%BA_-_%D1%81%D0%BC%D0%B0%D1%80%D1%82-%D1%82%D0%B5%D1%80%D0%BC%D0%B8%D0%BD%D0%B0%D0%BB%D1%8B\">платежный терминал</a> со встроенным <a href=\"https://www.cnews.ru/book/%D0%98%D1%81%D0%BA%D1%83%D1%81%D1%81%D1%82%D0%B2%D0%B5%D0%BD%D0%BD%D1%8B%D0%B9_%D0%B8%D0%BD%D1%82%D0%B5%D0%BB%D0%BB%D0%B5%D0%BA%D1%82_-_%D0%98%D0%98_-_Artificial_Intelligence_-_AI_-_Artificial_General_Intelligence_-_AGI_-_%D0%9E%D0%B1%D1%89%D0%B8%D0%B9_%D0%B8%D1%81%D0%BA%D1%83%D1%81%D1%81%D1%82%D0%B2%D0%B5%D0%BD%D0%BD%D1%8B%D0%B9_%D0%B8%D0%BD%D1%82%D0%B5%D0%BB%D0%BB%D0%B5%D0%BA%D1%82_-_%D0%98%D1%81%D0%BA%D1%83%D1%81%D1%81%D1%82%D0%B2%D0%B5%D0%BD%D0%BD%D1%8B%D0%B9_%D0%B8%D0%BD%D1%82%D0%B5%D0%BB%D0%BB%D0%B5%D0%BA%D1%82_%D0%BE%D0%B1%D1%89%D0%B5%D0%B3%D0%BE_%D0%BD%D0%B0%D0%B7%D0%BD%D0%B0%D1%87%D0%B5%D0%BD%D0%B8%D1%8F_-_%D0%A3%D0%BD%D0%B8%D0%B2%D0%B5%D1%80%D1%81%D0%B0%D0%BB%D1%8C%D0%BD%D1%8B%D0%B9_%D0%B8%D1%81%D0%BA%D1%83%D1%81%D1%81%D1%82%D0%B2%D0%B5%D0%BD%D0%BD%D1%8B%D0%B9_%D0%B8%D0%BD%D1%82%D0%B5%D0%BB%D0%BB%D0%B5%D0%BA%D1%82\">искусственным интеллектом</a>. Собственная разработка Сбербанка объединяет ИИ, <a href=\"https://www.cnews.ru/book/%D0%91%D0%B8%D0%BE%D0%BC%D0%B5%D1%82%D1%80%D0%B8%D1%8F_-_%D0%91%D0%B8%D0%BE%D0%BC%D0%B5%D1%82%D1%80%D0%B8%D1%87%D0%B5%D1%81%D0%BA%D0%B8%D0%B5_%D1%82%D0%B5%D1%85%D0%BD%D0%BE%D0%BB%D0%BE%D0%B3%D0%B8%D0%B8_-_%D0%91%D0%B8%D0%BE%D0%BC%D0%B5%D1%82%D1%80%D0%B8%D1%87%D0%B5%D1%81%D0%BA%D0%B0%D1%8F_%D0%B0%D1%83%D1%82%D0%B5%D0%BD%D1%82%D0%B8%D1%84%D0%B8%D0%BA%D0%B0%D1%86%D0%B8%D1%8F_-_%D0%91%D0%B8%D0%BE%D0%B8%D0%BD%D0%B4%D0%B5%D0%BD%D1%82%D0%B8%D1%84%D0%B8%D0%BA%D0%B0%D1%86%D0%B8%D1%8F_-_%D0%A1%D0%B5%D1%80%D0%B2%D0%B8%D1%81%D1%8B_%D0%B1%D0%B8%D0%BE%D0%BC%D0%B5%D1%82%D1%80%D0%B8%D1%87%D0%B5%D1%81%D0%BA%D0%BE%D0%B9_%D0%B7%D0%B0%D1%89%D0%B8%D1%82%D1%8B_%D0%B8%D0%BD%D1%84%D0%BE%D1%80%D0%BC%D0%B0%D1%86%D0%B8%D0%BE%D0%BD%D0%BD%D1%8B%D1%85_%D1%81%D0%B8%D1%81%D1%82%D0%B5%D0%BC_-_%D0%B1%D0%B8%D0%BE%D0%A1%D0%9A%D0%A3%D0%94\">биометрию</a>, локальные вычисления и цифровые сервисы в одном устройстве. Терминалы работают сразу во всех 22 окнах для обслуживания клиентов: через них пассажиры оплачивают <a href=\"https://www.cnews.ru/book/%D0%90%D0%B2%D0%B8%D0%B0%D0%BA%D0%BE%D0%BC%D0%BF%D0%B0%D0%BD%D0%B8%D1%8F_-_Airline_-_%D0%B0%D0%B2%D0%B8%D0%B0%D1%86%D0%B8%D0%BE%D0%BD%D0%BD%D0%B0%D1%8F_%D0%BA%D0%BE%D0%BC%D0%BF%D0%B0%D0%BD%D0%B8%D1%8F_-_%D0%B0%D0%B2%D0%B8%D0%B0%D0%BF%D1%80%D0%B5%D0%B4%D0%BF%D1%80%D0%B8%D1%8F%D1%82%D0%B8%D0%B5_%D1%82%D1%80%D0%B0%D0%BD%D1%81%D0%BF%D0%BE%D1%80%D1%82%D0%BD%D0%BE%D0%B5_-_%D0%B0%D0%B2%D0%B8%D0%B0%D1%82%D1%80%D0%B0%D0%BD%D1%81%D0%BF%D0%BE%D1%80%D1%82%D0%BD%D0%BE%D0%B5_%D0%BF%D1%80%D0%B5%D0%B4%D0%BF%D1%80%D0%B8%D1%8F%D1%82%D0%B8%D0%B5_-_%D0%B0%D0%B2%D0%B8%D0%B0%D0%BF%D0%B5%D1%80%D0%B5%D0%B2%D0%BE%D0%B7%D1%87%D0%B8%D0%BA%D0%B8\">авиабилеты</a> и дополнительные услуги. Об этом CNews сообщили представители <a href=\"https://www.cnews.ru/book/%D0%A1%D0%B1%D0%B5%D1%80_-_%D0%A1%D0%B1%D0%B5%D1%80%D0%B1%D0%B0%D0%BD%D0%BA_%D0%9F%D0%90%D0%9E_%D0%93%D0%9A_-_%D0%A0%D0%BE%D1%81%D1%81%D0%B8%D0%B9%D1%81%D0%BA%D0%B8%D0%B9_%D0%B3%D0%BE%D1%81%D1%83%D0%B4%D0%B0%D1%80%D1%81%D1%82%D0%B2%D0%B5%D0%BD%D0%BD%D1%8B%D0%B9_%D1%84%D0%B8%D0%BD%D0%B0%D0%BD%D1%81%D0%BE%D0%B2%D1%8B%D0%B9_%D0%BA%D0%BE%D0%BD%D0%B3%D0%BB%D0%BE%D0%BC%D0%B5%D1%80%D0%B0%D1%82\">Сбербанка</a>.</p>\n<p>Главная идея НЕО — технологии должны адаптироваться под человека, а не человек под технологии. Экран сам меняет угол наклона под пассажира. Биометрическая система <a href=\"https://www.cnews.ru/book/%D0%9C%D0%B0%D1%88%D0%B8%D0%BD%D0%BD%D0%BE%D0%B5_%D0%B7%D1%80%D0%B5%D0%BD%D0%B8%D0%B5_-_%D0%A0%D0%B0%D1%81%D0%BF%D0%BE%D0%B7%D0%BD%D0%B0%D0%B2%D0%B0%D0%BD%D0%B8%D0%B5_-_Recognition\">распознает</a> лицо при разном освещении. <a href=\"https://www.cnews.ru/book/FinTech_-_%D0%9F%D0%BB%D0%B0%D1%82%D1%91%D0%B6%D0%BD%D1%8B%D0%B5_%D1%81%D0%B8%D1%81%D1%82%D0%B5%D0%BC%D1%8B_-_%D0%AD%D0%BB%D0%B5%D0%BA%D1%82%D1%80%D0%BE%D0%BD%D0%BD%D1%8B%D0%B5_%D0%BF%D0%BB%D0%B0%D1%82%D0%B5%D0%B6%D0%BD%D1%8B%D0%B5_%D1%82%D0%B5%D1%85%D0%BD%D0%BE%D0%BB%D0%BE%D0%B3%D0%B8%D0%B8_-_EFT_-_Electronic_funds_transfer_-_Pay-%D1%81%D0%B5%D1%80%D0%B2%D0%B8%D1%81%D1%8B_-_E-invoicing\">Способ оплаты</a> человек выбирает сам: банковской картой, <a href=\"https://www.cnews.ru/book/%D0%A1%D0%B1%D0%B5%D1%80_-_SberPay_-_%D0%9C%D1%83%D0%BB%D1%8C%D1%82%D0%B8_QR_-_%D0%B1%D0%B5%D1%81%D0%BA%D0%BE%D0%BD%D1%82%D0%B0%D0%BA%D1%82%D0%BD%D0%B0%D1%8F_%D0%BE%D0%BF%D0%BB%D0%B0%D1%82%D0%B0_%D0%BF%D0%BE_QR-%D0%BA%D0%BE%D0%B4%D1%83_-_%D0%9E%D0%BF%D0%BB%D0%B0%D1%82%D0%B0_%D0%BE%D0%B4%D0%BD%D0%B8%D0%BC_%D0%B2%D0%B7%D0%B3%D0%BB%D1%8F%D0%B4%D0%BE%D0%BC_-_%D0%9E%D0%BF%D0%BB%D0%B0%D1%82%D0%B0_%D1%83%D0%BB%D1%8B%D0%B1%D0%BA%D0%BE%D0%B9\">улыбкой</a>, бесконтактной оплатой «<a href=\"https://www.cnews.ru/book/%D0%A1%D0%B1%D0%B5%D1%80_-_%D0%A1%D0%B1%D0%B5%D1%80%D0%B1%D0%B0%D0%BD%D0%BA_%D0%9E%D0%BD%D0%BB%D0%B0%D0%B9%D0%BD_-_%D0%92%D0%B6%D1%83%D1%85\">Вжух</a>» по SberPay NFC или по единому <a href=\"https://www.cnews.ru/book/QR-%D0%BA%D0%BE%D0%B4_-_QR_code_-_Quick_Response_Code_-_%D0%9A%D0%BE%D0%B4_%D0%B1%D1%8B%D1%81%D1%82%D1%80%D0%BE%D0%B3%D0%BE_%D1%80%D0%B5%D0%B0%D0%B3%D0%B8%D1%80%D0%BE%D0%B2%D0%B0%D0%BD%D0%B8%D1%8F\">QR-коду</a>.</p>\n<p>За этой работой стоят конкретные решения. <a href=\"https://www.cnews.ru/book/ToF_camera_-_Time-of-flight_%D0%BA%D0%B0%D0%BC%D0%B5%D1%80%D0%B0\">ToF-камера</a> строит <a href=\"https://www.cnews.ru/book/3D_%D1%82%D0%B5%D1%85%D0%BD%D0%BE%D0%BB%D0%BE%D0%B3%D0%B8%D0%B8_-_%D1%82%D1%80%D0%B5%D1%85%D0%BC%D0%B5%D1%80%D0%BD%D1%8B%D0%B5_%D1%82%D0%B5%D1%85%D0%BD%D0%BE%D0%BB%D0%BE%D0%B3%D0%B8%D0%B8_-_3-dimensional_-_3D-%D0%BC%D0%BE%D0%B4%D0%B5%D0%BB%D0%B8%D1%80%D0%BE%D0%B2%D0%B0%D0%BD%D0%B8%D0%B5_-_3D-%D0%BF%D1%80%D0%BE%D0%B5%D0%BA%D1%82%D0%B8%D1%80%D0%BE%D0%B2%D0%B0%D0%BD%D0%B8%D0%B5_-_3D-%D0%B4%D0%B8%D0%B7%D0%B0%D0%B9%D0%BD_-_3D-%D1%81%D0%BA%D0%B0%D0%BD%D0%B8%D1%80%D0%BE%D0%B2%D0%B0%D0%BD%D0%B8%D0%B5\">трехмерную</a> карту лица. Широкий угол обзора, адаптивная подсветка и алгоритмы распознавания помогают узнать <a href=\"https://www.cnews.ru/book/%D0%A2%D1%80%D0%B0%D0%BD%D1%81%D0%BF%D0%BE%D1%80%D1%82_%D0%BE%D0%B1%D1%89%D0%B5%D1%81%D1%82%D0%B2%D0%B5%D0%BD%D0%BD%D1%8B%D0%B9_-_%D0%9A%D0%BE%D0%BC%D0%BC%D1%83%D0%BD%D0%B0%D0%BB%D1%8C%D0%BD%D1%8B%D0%B9_%D1%82%D1%80%D0%B0%D0%BD%D1%81%D0%BF%D0%BE%D1%80%D1%82_-_%D0%9F%D0%B0%D1%81%D1%81%D0%B0%D0%B6%D0%B8%D1%80%D1%81%D0%BA%D0%B8%D0%B5_%D0%BF%D0%B5%D1%80%D0%B5%D0%B2%D0%BE%D0%B7%D0%BA%D0%B8_-_Public_transport_-_Passenger_transportation_-_%D0%BC%D1%83%D0%BD%D0%B8%D1%86%D0%B8%D0%BF%D0%B0%D0%BB%D1%8C%D0%BD%D1%8B%D0%B5_%D0%B8_%D0%BA%D0%BE%D0%BC%D0%BC%D0%B5%D1%80%D1%87%D0%B5%D1%81%D0%BA%D0%B8%D0%B5_%D0%B0%D0%B2%D1%82%D0%BE%D0%B1%D1%83%D1%81%D1%8B_%D1%82%D1%80%D0%BE%D0%BB%D0%BB%D0%B5%D0%B9%D0%B1%D1%83%D1%81%D1%8B_%D0%B8_%D1%82%D1%80%D0%B0%D0%BC%D0%B2%D0%B0%D0%B8\">пассажира</a> при разном свете. Восьмиядерный <a href=\"https://www.cnews.ru/book/%D0%AD%D0%BB%D0%B5%D0%BA%D1%82%D1%80%D0%BE%D0%BD%D0%B8%D0%BA%D0%B0_-_CPU_-_Central_processing_unit_-_chiplet_%D1%87%D0%B8%D0%BF%D0%BB%D0%B5%D1%82_-_%D0%A6%D0%9F%D0%A3_-_%D0%A6%D0%B5%D0%BD%D1%82%D1%80%D0%B0%D0%BB%D1%8C%D0%BD%D1%8B%D0%B9_%D0%BC%D0%B8%D0%BA%D1%80%D0%BE%D0%BF%D1%80%D0%BE%D1%86%D0%B5%D1%81%D1%81%D0%BE%D1%80_-_%D0%A6%D0%B5%D0%BD%D1%82%D1%80%D0%B0%D0%BB%D1%8C%D0%BD%D0%BE%D0%B5_%D0%BF%D1%80%D0%BE%D1%86%D0%B5%D1%81%D1%81%D0%BE%D1%80%D0%BD%D0%BE%D0%B5_%D1%83%D1%81%D1%82%D1%80%D0%BE%D0%B9%D1%81%D1%82%D0%B2%D0%BE_-_%D0%9F%D1%80%D0%BE%D1%86%D0%B5%D1%81%D1%81%D0%BE%D1%80%D0%BD%D1%8B%D0%B9_%D0%BC%D0%BE%D0%B4%D1%83%D0%BB%D1%8C\">процессор</a> держит интерфейс, <a href=\"https://www.cnews.ru/book/NPU_-_Numeric_floating_point_Processing_Unit_-_%D0%9D%D0%B5%D0%B9%D1%80%D0%BE%D0%BF%D1%80%D0%BE%D1%86%D0%B5%D1%81%D1%81%D0%BE%D1%80_-_%D0%BD%D0%B5%D0%B7%D0%B0%D0%B2%D0%B8%D1%81%D0%B8%D0%BC%D1%8B%D0%B9_%D0%BC%D0%B0%D1%82%D0%B5%D0%BC%D0%B0%D1%82%D0%B8%D1%87%D0%B5%D1%81%D0%BA%D0%B8%D0%B9_%D1%81%D0%BE%D0%BF%D1%80%D0%BE%D1%86%D0%B5%D1%81%D1%81%D0%BE%D1%80\">NPU</a>-<a href=\"https://www.cnews.ru/book/Microchip_-_%D0%A7%D0%B8%D0%BF_-_%D0%9C%D0%B8%D0%BA%D1%80%D0%BE%D1%87%D0%B8%D0%BF_-_%D0%A7%D0%B8%D0%BF-%D0%B8%D0%BC%D0%BF%D0%BB%D0%B0%D0%BD%D1%82%D0%B0%D1%82-_%D0%98%D0%BD%D1%82%D0%B5%D0%B3%D1%80%D0%B0%D0%BB%D1%8C%D0%BD%D0%B0%D1%8F_%D0%BC%D0%B8%D0%BA%D1%80%D0%BE%D1%81%D1%85%D0%B5%D0%BC%D0%B0\">чип</a> считает задачи искусственного интеллекта на самом устройстве. Разрешение экрана на 60% выше, чем у предыдущего поколения.</p>\n    <a href=\"https://www.cnconf.ru/events/lcnc_revolyuciya_novaya_arhitektura_cifrovoi_nezavisimosti.shtml\">\n        <img src=\"https://static.cnews.ru/img/cnews/2026/05/26/low-code.webp\" alt=\"Low/no-code-революция: новая архитектура цифровой независимости\">\n        <p>Low/no-code-революция: новая архитектура цифровой независимости\n            Конференция\n        </p>\n    </a>\n\n        \n    \n    \n        \n        \n    \n    \n    \n\n    \n        \n    \n    \n    \n            <ul>\n<li><a href=\"https://cnewsforum.ru/forum/\">CNews Forum 2026: Информационные технологии завтра</a></li>\n</ul>\n\n    \n        \n    \n    \n\n    \n    \n\n\n\n\n\n    \n    \n\n\n    \n\n\t\t<p>\n\t\t\t</p><h2>Другие материалы рубрики</h2>\n\t\t<p></p>\n\t\t\n\t\n\n<!-- конференции -->\n    \n\n<!-